# What `vercel deploy` uploads: everything at the top level is ignored, then only the site's files are
# allowed back. Secrets (.env), local data, the virtual environment and tests are never uploaded.
/*
!app.py
!vercel.json
!requirements.txt
!.python-version
!backend
!frontend

# backend: only the code and the trained model (train it on your computer before deploying)
backend/*
!backend/algotrader
!backend/models

# frontend: only the built dashboard
frontend/*
!frontend/dist
frontend/dist/**/*.map

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
